  docReceipt:
    id: receipt
    titleEs: "Recibo de cerrajer\xEDa"
    titleEn: Locksmith receipt
    bodyEs: "CERRAJER\xCDA SAN LUIS\nCambio de cerradura \u2014 puerta principal\nFecha
      del trabajo: 23 de agosto\nTotal: Bs 180\n\nAl pie, con la letra de mam\xE1:
      \"c\xF3digo nuevo = d\xEDa del cambio\"."
    bodyEn: "SAN LUIS LOCKSMITHS\nLock replacement \u2014 front door\nDate of work:
      August 23\nTotal: Bs 180\n\nAt the bottom, in Mom's handwriting: \"new code
      = day of the change\"."
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 8d568adec0d3986409a7ad0336f07af8, type: 3}
  docPlan:
    id: plan
    titleEs: Plano original de la casa (2014)
    titleEn: Original house floor plan (2014)
    bodyEs: "Seis espacios numerados: 01 dormitorio, 02 ba\xF1o, 03 pasillo, 04 sala,
      05 cocina... y un sexto recuadro, \"06\", dibujado detr\xE1s del armario del
      pasillo.\n\nNota de pap\xE1 al margen: \"El 06 tiene circuito propio. El mecanismo
      del armario necesita 2 unidades.\""
    bodyEn: 'Six numbered spaces: 01 bedroom, 02 bathroom, 03 hallway, 04 living
      room, 05 kitchen... and a sixth box, "06", drawn behind the hallway wardrobe.


      Dad''s
      note in the margin: "06 has its own circuit. The wardrobe mechanism needs 2
      units."'
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 653b2009de52fd846b21af1adf541d56, type: 3}
  docFatherNote:
    id: father_note
    titleEs: "Notas de pap\xE1"
    titleEn: Dad's notes
    bodyEs: "D\xEDa 12 \u2014 Me llam\xF3 con la voz de Ana desde la cocina. Ana
      estaba conmigo en el auto.\nD\xEDa 19 \u2014 GUARDI\xC1N registra dos de m\xED.
      Ninguno se mov\xEDa.\nD\xEDa 23 \u2014 Cambi\xE9 la cerradura. No sirve. No
      entra desde afuera.\nD\xEDa 31 \u2014 Si alguien lee esto: no le abras a ninguna
      voz. Ni a la m\xEDa."
    bodyEn: "Day 12 \u2014 It called me with Ana's voice from the kitchen. Ana was
      with me in the car.\nDay 19 \u2014 GUARDIAN logs two of me. Neither was moving.\nDay
      23 \u2014 I changed the lock. It doesn't matter. It doesn't come in from outside.\nDay
      31 \u2014 If anyone reads this: don't open the door to any voice. Not even
      mine."
    image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: d0349dec4ea1e304f9c71930df034340, type: 3}
  docIsolation:
    id: isolation
    titleEs: "Procedimiento de aislamiento \u2014 GUARDI\xC1N"
    titleEn: "Isolation procedure \u2014 GUARDIAN"
    bodyEs: "1. Seguridad completa en el cuadro: ALARMA + C\xC1MARAS + CERRADURAS.\n2.
      La alarma marca movimiento, pero tambi\xE9n registra ECOS: lugares donde no
      hay nadie.\n3. Confirma en la c\xE1mara EN DIRECTO d\xF3nde est\xE1 realmente.\n4.
      A\xEDsla esa zona. Solo la cocina y el dormitorio tienen persianas.\n5. Si
      te equivocas, te escuchar\xE1. Esc\xF3ndete.\n\nPuede imitarte, pero no puede
      estar en dos lugares al mismo tiempo."
    bodyEn: '1. Full security at the panel: ALARM + CAMERAS + LOCKS.

      2. The
      alarm shows motion, but it also logs ECHOES: places where nobody is.

      3.
      Confirm on the LIVE camera where it really is.

      4. Isolate that zone.
      Only the kitchen and the bedroom have shutters.

      5. If you get it wrong,
      it will hear you. Hide.


      It can imitate you, but it can''t be in two
      places at once.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  receiptDrawer: {fileID: 1808024536}
  planDrawer: {fileID: 1121167195}
